      "id": "engineering",
      "topic": "engineering",
      "basis": "interpretation",
      "text": "值得借鉴的是将执行世界作为预设变体、保留上游文件语义，再对不成立的9P沙箱形状明确拒绝。代价是深度依赖多个宿主服务及版本分支；fs后端与shell身份差异需要作为公开契约维护。wsl-bash-tty.ts把PTY封装与输出归一化独立，便于隔离终端特性，但重试可能重复副作用须在会话层处理。 源码依据：[src/index.ts](https://github.com/dsh-wsl-workspace-maintainers/dsh-wsl-workspace/blob/00106d9575d8d087daec0596dd51f283f78dcdbb/src/index.ts)、[src/fs.ts](https://github.com/dsh-wsl-workspace-maintainers/dsh-wsl-workspace/blob/00106d9575d8d087daec0596dd51f283f78dcdbb/src/fs.ts)、[src/host/wsl-run-code-guard.ts](https://github.com/dsh-wsl-workspace-maintainers/dsh-wsl-workspace/blob/00106d9575d8d087daec0596dd51f283f78dcdbb/src/host/wsl-run-code-guard.ts)、[src/host/wsl-bash-tty.ts](https://github.com/dsh-wsl-workspace-maintainers/dsh-wsl-workspace/blob/00106d9575d8d087daec0596dd51f283f78dcdbb/src/host/wsl-bash-tty.ts)、[NOTICE](https://github.com/dsh-wsl-workspace-maintainers/dsh-wsl-workspace/blob/00106d9575d8d087daec0596dd51f283f78dcdbb/NOTICE)。",
